(:id "dart/W16" :state :unknown :note "the clause \"nested union answers outer tag\": the dart emitter lays down only the inner tag for an entry under an arm inside an arm (the plan carries no outer condition), and tableFixedRun checks one guard only, so the generated reader runs an inner arm whenever the byte at the inner offset matches whatever the outer tag holds.")
(:id "dart/R28" :state :unknown :note "the clause \"the plan entry carries offset+count into a pool of (guard, arg, argw) links, outermost first; an arm inside an arm answers to the OUTER tag\": the dart identity plan (fixedplan.go fixedPlanElement) carries one (guard, arg, argw) triple per entry and no chain pool, and fixedmodule.go emits nine lanes with no chainAt/chainN, so the generated reader has no guard chain and no pool.")
